 b           |                2 | YES         | character varying        |                       10 |                   |               | 
 c           |                3 | YES         | numeric                  |                          |                 8 |             3 | 1.5
 d           |                4 | YES         | timestamp with time zone |                          |                   |               | 
 e           |                5 | NO          | text                     |                          |                   |               | 
 f           |                6 | YES         | ARRAY                    |                          |                   |               | 
